'''Qichi Village''' is an area of {{Location|Central Plains}}. The village was abandoned many years ago due to an unknown tragedy in which almost all of the villagers were killed, and some were transformed into [[Tacet Discord]]s. [[Scar]] attributes the destruction to a mysterious individual referred to only as "[[The Shepherd]]."<ref>[[Main Quest]]: [[Ominous Star]]</ref> Ever since, the surrounding landscape has been transformed, and a large [[Tacet Field]] has appeared in a cavern beneath the town.

